{"setting":"dome","title":"The Truman Show · The exit","description":"The complete supplied ending: sailboat, painted horizon, staircase, exit, control room and viewers, with seven physical dialogue voices and the original music and effects.","duration":315.35,"audio":"mix.mp3","characters":[{"id":"truman","name":"Truman Burbank","role":"At the edge of his world · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"truman.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"christof","name":"Christof","role":"The creator in the control room · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"christof.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"sylvia","name":"Sylvia","role":"Hoping he leaves · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"sylvia.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"network-exec","name":"Network executive","role":"Cease transmission · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"network-exec.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"broadcast-director","name":"Broadcast director","role":"Ending the broadcast · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"broadcast-director.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"guard-one","name":"Security guard · right","role":"Watching the finale · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"guard-one.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"guard-two","name":"Security guard · left","role":"Another slice? · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"guard-two.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"}],"cues":[{"start":48.58,"end":50.507536,"speaker":"christof","text":"I want to talk to him.","intensity":0.42},{"start":69.06,"end":70.08969459999999,"speaker":"christof","text":"Truman.","intensity":0.42},{"start":79.92122,"end":80.452703,"speaker":"christof","text":"Truman.","intensity":0.42},{"start":82.44552,"end":83.41325,"speaker":"christof","text":"You can speak.","intensity":0.42},{"start":85.82961,"end":86.7129355,"speaker":"christof","text":"I can hear you.","intensity":0.42},{"start":91.86521,"end":92.68385,"speaker":"truman","text":"Who are you?","intensity":0.5},{"start":92.9812,"end":99.74372,"speaker":"christof","text":"I am the creator of a television show that gives hope and joy and inspiration to millions.","intensity":0.42},{"start":103.50357,"end":104.29692299999999,"speaker":"truman","text":"Then who am I?","intensity":0.5},{"start":105.40309,"end":106.78477000000001,"speaker":"christof","text":"You are the star.","intensity":0.42},{"start":112.84437,"end":114.0158685,"speaker":"truman","text":"Was nothing real?","intensity":0.5},{"start":114.74325,"end":116.003272,"speaker":"christof","text":"You were real.","intensity":0.42},{"start":117.50354,"end":119.895228,"speaker":"christof","text":"It's what made you so good to watch.","intensity":0.42},{"start":120.44374,"end":121.790819,"speaker":"christof","text":"Listen to me, Truman.","intensity":0.42},{"start":122.06257,"end":124.51209850000001,"speaker":"christof","text":"There's no more truth out there","intensity":0.42},{"start":125.30251,"end":128.70184,"speaker":"christof","text":"than there is in the world I created for you.","intensity":0.42},{"start":129.9236,"end":130.935392,"speaker":"christof","text":"Same lies.","intensity":0.42},{"start":133.16338,"end":134.451212,"speaker":"christof","text":"The same deceit.","intensity":0.42},{"start":135.46313,"end":136.8563492,"speaker":"christof","text":"But in my world,","intensity":0.42},{"start":139.02371,"end":140.7476295,"speaker":"christof","text":"you have nothing to fear.","intensity":0.42},{"start":144.02348,"end":147.1840592,"speaker":"christof","text":"I know you better than you know yourself.","intensity":0.42},{"start":147.3140592,"end":149.4164577,"speaker":"truman","text":"You never had a camera in my head.","intensity":0.5},{"start":150.42363,"end":151.52019,"speaker":"christof","text":"You're afraid.","intensity":0.42},{"start":153.12297,"end":155.16648399999997,"speaker":"christof","text":"That's why you can't leave.","intensity":0.42},{"start":159.48405,"end":160.685056,"speaker":"christof","text":"It's okay, Truman.","intensity":0.42},{"start":162.28462,"end":163.3982055,"speaker":"christof","text":"I understand.","intensity":0.42},{"start":165.0029,"end":167.77242900000002,"speaker":"christof","text":"I have been watching you your whole life.","intensity":0.42},{"start":170.26348,"end":172.4217035,"speaker":"christof","text":"I was watching when you were born.","intensity":0.42},{"start":174.86219,"end":178.26301,"speaker":"christof","text":"I was watching when you took your first step.","intensity":0.42},{"start":181.72221,"end":184.7806225,"speaker":"christof","text":"I watched you on your first day of school.","intensity":0.42},{"start":187.00251,"end":190.26570600000002,"speaker":"christof","text":"The episode when you lost your first tooth.","intensity":0.42},{"start":193.62,"end":195.58447679999998,"speaker":"christof","text":"You can't leave, Truman.","intensity":0.42},{"start":197.58344,"end":199.09944140000002,"speaker":"sylvia","text":"Please, God.","intensity":0.5},{"start":199.2294414,"end":200.4488814,"speaker":"christof","text":"You belong here.","intensity":0.42},{"start":200.68398,"end":201.87049199999998,"speaker":"sylvia","text":"You can do it.","intensity":0.5},{"start":203.7839,"end":204.51062,"speaker":"christof","text":"With me.","intensity":0.42},{"start":207.42348,"end":208.18676,"speaker":"christof","text":"Talk to me.","intensity":0.42},{"start":210.12408,"end":211.150825,"speaker":"christof","text":"Say something.","intensity":0.42},{"start":216.04275,"end":218.113437,"speaker":"christof","text":"Say something, God damn it!","intensity":0.42},{"start":218.243437,"end":219.93628299999997,"speaker":"christof","text":"You're on television!","intensity":0.42},{"start":220.06628299999997,"end":222.20119819999996,"speaker":"christof","text":"You're live to the whole world!","intensity":0.42},{"start":238.92163,"end":244.45577200000002,"speaker":"truman","text":"In case I don't see ya, good afternoon, good evening, and good night.","intensity":0.5},{"start":269.78,"end":270.8096946,"speaker":"sylvia","text":"Yeah!","intensity":0.5},{"start":281.55,"end":284.221942,"speaker":"guard-one","text":"He made it! Yeah!","intensity":0.5},{"start":284.87135,"end":285.3683204,"speaker":"guard-two","text":"Yeah!","intensity":0.5},{"start":296.12574,"end":297.26852849999995,"speaker":"network-exec","text":"Cease transmission.","intensity":0.5},{"start":297.39852849999994,"end":299.25449649999996,"speaker":"broadcast-director","text":"Ceasing transmission.","intensity":0.5},{"start":303.02433,"end":304.34137949999996,"speaker":"guard-two","text":"You want another slice?","intensity":0.5},{"start":304.47137949999995,"end":305.38097899999997,"speaker":"guard-one","text":"No, I'm okay.","intensity":0.5},{"start":306.26418,"end":307.62325200000004,"speaker":"guard-one","text":"What else is on?","intensity":0.5},{"start":307.75325200000003,"end":309.53736100000003,"speaker":"guard-two","text":"Yeah, let's see what else is on.","intensity":0.5},{"start":309.667361,"end":310.81651500000004,"speaker":"guard-one","text":"Where's the TV Guide?","intensity":0.5}],"shots":[{"time":0.0,"view":"dome-boat"},{"time":20.899216,"view":"wide"},{"time":27.258353,"view":"dome-wall"},{"time":34.511206,"view":"dome-wall"},{"time":42.52028,"view":"truman"},{"time":49.291902,"view":"dome-stairs"},{"time":58.607177,"view":"dome-stairs"},{"time":61.735185,"view":"dome-exit"},{"time":65.550667,"view":"truman"},{"time":67.819332,"view":"christof"},{"time":73.903479,"view":"control-monitor"},{"time":79.231404,"view":"dome-exit"},{"time":81.396948,"view":"control-monitor"},{"time":83.493744,"view":"dome-sky"},{"time":86.896741,"view":"truman"},{"time":92.499656,"view":"christof"},{"time":99.065035,"view":"control-monitor"},{"time":104.564829,"view":"truman"},{"time":107.108483,"view":"christof"},{"time":114.155094,"view":"truman"},{"time":116.0,"view":"christof"},{"time":119.104909,"view":"truman"},{"time":121.648563,"view":"christof"},{"time":127.767084,"view":"truman"},{"time":134.744947,"view":"chris